WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.237
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:03.507 --> 00:07.213
I remember it in the most unexpected moments.

3
00:07.213 --> 00:11.241
My heart racing beyond control,

4
00:11.241 --> 00:15.557
and when everything seemed to shine.

5
00:16.665 --> 00:19.708
[Meigakusha]

6
00:21.171 --> 00:22.685
- Ms. Yamane. - Yes?

7
00:22.685 --> 00:23.924
Is this the document?

8
00:23.924 --> 00:28.491
I think I'm living all right in the present.

9
00:28.491 --> 00:33.655
I have a gentle family, and coworkers at a comfortable distance.

10
00:33.655 --> 00:35.961
The interim report is done.

11
00:35.961 --> 00:38.767
Did the parent company say anything? [Development Project Report]

12
00:38.767 --> 00:41.046
They said there are no problems.

13
00:41.046 --> 00:43.640
Looks like we can start developing on time.

14
00:43.640 --> 00:47.643
Then we need to speak with the vendor about a contract.

15
00:47.643 --> 00:51.726
And we have to discuss having an engineer stationed here.

16
00:53.270 --> 00:55.289
Want me to help?

17
00:55.289 --> 00:58.415
No, I'll do my best. Thank you.

18
00:58.415 --> 00:59.821
I see.

19
01:00.979 --> 01:03.012
Everyone, good work!

20
01:03.012 --> 01:05.671
Good work!

21
01:05.671 --> 01:07.108
Here, ice cream.

22
01:07.108 --> 01:08.366
It's hot today.

23
01:08.366 --> 01:11.330
What? I was planning to fast, though.

24
01:11.330 --> 01:14.051
It's fine. Ice cream is water.

25
01:14.051 --> 01:16.718
- Thank you. I'll have some. - Thank you.

26
01:16.718 --> 01:18.078
Ms. Yamane, here.

27
01:18.078 --> 01:20.082
Thank you.

28
01:21.706 --> 01:23.235
Take one.

29
01:23.235 --> 01:24.736
But...

30
01:36.965 --> 01:39.724
[Yamane]

31
01:44.272 --> 01:45.625
I'm home.

32
01:45.625 --> 01:47.106
Welcome back.

33
01:48.673 --> 01:51.632
This came from Mom and Dad.

34
01:51.632 --> 01:53.719
Thanks.

35
01:55.808 --> 02:00.592
Oh, and apparently... there's a class reunion.

36
02:03.690 --> 02:06.657
[Class Reunion Notice]

37
02:06.657 --> 02:10.654
[Tsurushiro High School, Class of 2019 Graduates - Reunion Venue]

38
02:18.853 --> 02:22.024
[Sorry, I can't make it today. Got stuck at work.]

39
02:39.518 --> 02:41.106
Excuse me...

40
02:43.579 --> 02:45.596
You're Yamane, right?

41
02:46.946 --> 02:49.213
Yes, that's me.

42
02:51.291 --> 02:53.086
Do you remember me?

43
02:54.590 --> 02:56.504
It's me. Taguchi.

44
02:59.502 --> 03:01.656
Taguchi?

45
03:11.522 --> 03:13.469
Wait, what?

46
03:13.469 --> 03:16.722
Long time no see, Yamane.

47
04:02.701 --> 04:04.287
Can I sit?

48
04:04.287 --> 04:06.669
Oh, sure.

49
04:07.698 --> 04:11.300
I didn't have anyone to talk to, so this really helps. Thanks.

50
04:11.300 --> 04:12.773
No problem.

51
04:14.892 --> 04:16.491
Are you drinking?

52
04:17.257 --> 04:18.675
I am.

53
04:18.675 --> 04:20.181
Want another?

54
04:20.181 --> 04:22.908
No, I'm fine.

55
04:28.919 --> 04:32.282
You seem like a different person, somehow.

56
04:32.282 --> 04:33.829
Huh?

57
04:34.677 --> 04:37.904
I mean, back then, you...

58
04:38.680 --> 04:41.254
were a bit prickly.

59
04:41.254 --> 04:42.996
Who are you?

60
04:45.898 --> 04:48.301
This is my spot.

61
04:52.505 --> 04:54.730
Prickly?

62
04:54.730 --> 05:00.436
Your look, the way you talked... I don't mean it in a bad way.

63
05:02.500 --> 05:05.988
Doesn't sound like a compliment either, huh?

64
05:08.377 --> 05:12.944
Well... You haven't changed, Yamane.

65
05:13.859 --> 05:15.047
You think so?

66
05:15.047 --> 05:16.316
Yeah.

67
05:16.316 --> 05:21.251
I mean, even with all these people here, you're still in the corner.

68
05:22.414 --> 05:24.498
Sorry.

69
05:29.725 --> 05:31.351
A first-year?

70
05:32.053 --> 05:33.853
Huh?

71
05:33.853 --> 05:36.352
Our indoor shoes' colors match.

72
05:40.132 --> 05:42.953
Isn't it time for homeroom?

73
05:42.953 --> 05:45.840
For sports festival prep or something?

74
05:49.594 --> 05:55.068
Well, I was having trouble getting along with everyone.

75
05:56.469 --> 05:59.669
And I couldn't stand it anymore,

76
06:00.343 --> 06:02.573
so I ended up here.

77
06:05.045 --> 06:08.685
Well, I'm being a bother, aren't I?

78
06:13.883 --> 06:16.403
Then you're the same as me.

79
06:26.386 --> 06:28.187
So...

80
06:29.305 --> 06:34.133
Does that mean I can stay here too?

81
06:37.836 --> 06:39.609
Do whatever you want.

82
07:02.721 --> 07:04.881
They're so cool.

83
07:07.764 --> 07:09.278
Huh?

84
07:10.613 --> 07:15.167
I mean, your piercings. I think they're cool.

85
07:17.715 --> 07:19.544
They don't scare you?

86
07:20.731 --> 07:22.275
Huh?

87
07:22.275 --> 07:23.909
I mean...

88
07:25.021 --> 07:27.287
I put them in because I like them,

89
07:27.287 --> 07:30.027
but I get told they're gross or scary.

90
07:31.350 --> 07:33.978
Oh, I see...

91
07:33.978 --> 07:35.384
Yeah.

92
07:38.191 --> 07:42.848
I think they suit you. They look nice.

93
07:46.505 --> 07:47.965
You do?

94
07:55.852 --> 07:58.232
I want ice cream.

95
07:58.232 --> 08:00.186
Is the store open?

96
08:00.777 --> 08:04.424
It's probably closed during class, isn't it?

97
08:08.346 --> 08:10.386
Wanna sneak out then?

98
08:16.246 --> 08:18.297
So...

99
08:18.957 --> 08:20.804
wanna sneak out again?

100
08:27.942 --> 08:30.064
Yeah.

101
08:30.064 --> 08:31.557
Let's go.

102
08:56.584 --> 08:58.725
- See you. - Bye.

103
09:03.343 --> 09:04.896
Sorry, I'm late!

104
09:04.896 --> 09:06.824
What were you doing?

105
09:06.824 --> 09:09.984
They suddenly started talking about relocations and stuff.

106
09:09.984 --> 09:11.379
Is everyone here?

107
09:11.379 --> 09:13.286
Yeah, look.

108
09:21.200 --> 09:23.354
Looking for someone?

109
09:23.354 --> 09:25.803
No, not really.

110
09:26.400 --> 09:27.981
Thanks.

111
09:31.091 --> 09:32.719
Here you go.

112
09:32.719 --> 09:34.836
Thank you.

113
09:40.144 --> 09:42.205
What's wrong?

114
09:42.205 --> 09:43.593
This is nice.

115
09:43.593 --> 09:46.358
Having a place like this as your regular spot.

116
09:46.358 --> 09:51.590
No, I'm not good with loud places,

117
09:51.590 --> 09:54.727
so quiet spots like this calm me down.

118
09:56.139 --> 09:58.216
They calm you down?

119
09:58.216 --> 09:59.589
Yeah.

120
10:00.276 --> 10:02.764
I don't usually visit places like this.

121
10:02.764 --> 10:04.228
Oh, really?

122
10:04.228 --> 10:05.935
Yeah.

123
10:05.935 --> 10:08.368
- Here. - Thank you.

124
10:09.607 --> 10:11.143
Well, then...

125
10:13.116 --> 10:14.403
Cheers.

126
10:14.403 --> 10:15.976
Cheers.

127
10:29.872 --> 10:31.432
Thanks.

128
10:40.908 --> 10:42.558
What's your name?

129
10:42.558 --> 10:43.945
Huh?

130
10:46.396 --> 10:48.379
I'm Taguchi.

131
10:50.192 --> 10:52.052
Ryosuke Taguchi.

132
10:54.363 --> 10:57.806
I'm Shiori Yamane.

133
11:00.900 --> 11:03.113
Yamane, is the ice cream good?

134
11:03.961 --> 11:07.335
Yeah. It's good.

135
11:07.335 --> 11:08.783
Right?

136
11:11.171 --> 11:15.252
So... I'm in Class 4.

137
11:15.252 --> 11:17.118
What about you, Taguchi?

138
11:17.118 --> 11:18.601
Class 5.

139
11:19.846 --> 11:23.411
Then, are you in any clubs?

140
11:23.411 --> 11:26.946
No. Why do you want to know?

141
11:28.161 --> 11:35.818
I was just curious about what kind of person you are,

142
11:35.818 --> 11:39.066
what you like, and so on.

143
11:39.066 --> 11:41.220
I see.

144
11:43.079 --> 11:45.729
Well, I'm exactly what I look like.

145
11:45.729 --> 11:47.957
I've got no friends.

146
11:47.957 --> 11:50.369
Plus, I like dressing like this,

147
11:50.369 --> 11:53.022
and no one can stop me.

148
11:55.311 --> 11:58.108
It's really important to you, huh?

149
12:01.320 --> 12:03.273
Yeah, I guess.

150
12:15.855 --> 12:17.921
Hey!

151
12:17.921 --> 12:20.563
What are you two doing here?

152
12:33.056 --> 12:35.165
Yamane, are you drunk?

153
12:36.365 --> 12:38.911
- I'm not drunk. - You definitely are.

154
12:38.911 --> 12:40.288
Let's go home.

155
12:40.288 --> 12:42.261
Check, please.

156
12:42.261 --> 12:44.063
Yes, sir.

157
12:52.973 --> 12:54.639
Your piercings.

158
12:56.474 --> 12:58.736
You don't wear them anymore?

159
13:00.148 --> 13:01.960
Why bring that up?

160
13:01.960 --> 13:04.750
Would it get you in trouble at work?

161
13:04.750 --> 13:07.459
No, that's not it.

162
13:07.459 --> 13:12.961
I stopped a long time ago, and I dyed my hair black too, see?

163
13:17.667 --> 13:23.566
This way, I get along better with the people around me.

164
13:25.195 --> 13:27.427
Besides, I'm an adult now.

165
13:29.609 --> 13:33.402
If you want to be seen positively, you have to dress the part.

166
13:41.972 --> 13:46.340
Taguchi, you've changed.

167
13:50.428 --> 13:52.631
Your looks...

168
13:53.791 --> 13:57.976
And everything inside feels so grown up.

169
13:59.449 --> 14:01.714
And you're so cool.

170
14:04.441 --> 14:09.964
But I'd like to see the Taguchi with piercings again...

171
14:11.263 --> 14:13.761
in the future sometime.

172
14:28.742 --> 14:30.461
Hey, so...

173
14:31.914 --> 14:33.524
So...

174
14:38.253 --> 14:39.953
Yamane?

175
14:42.224 --> 14:44.221
[Staff Room] Who you are today

176
14:44.221 --> 14:46.731
creates who you are tomorrow.

177
14:46.731 --> 14:51.609
A person is made up of that kind of continuity.

178
14:51.609 --> 14:57.714
So just doing whatever's fun right now isn't proper.

179
14:57.714 --> 14:59.953
You understand?

180
14:59.953 --> 15:04.186
Yes. I'm sorry.

181
15:05.304 --> 15:09.613
Taguchi, I've told you before.

182
15:09.613 --> 15:12.115
What's with the hair and piercings?

183
15:12.115 --> 15:14.578
Our school's rules aren't that strict.

184
15:14.578 --> 15:17.174
But there's a limit.

185
15:18.199 --> 15:21.215
Hey, I'm taking your piercings.

186
15:24.024 --> 15:25.909
Your piercings.

187
15:32.112 --> 15:33.913
What a pain...

188
15:52.737 --> 15:54.657
Excuse us.

189
16:03.215 --> 16:05.401
What about your piercings?

190
16:07.129 --> 16:08.421
It's fine.

191
16:08.421 --> 16:10.583
I'm used to that kind of thing.

192
16:10.583 --> 16:13.303
Anyway, don't worry about it.

193
16:17.981 --> 16:20.074
I had fun.

194
16:24.303 --> 16:29.329
Ever since I started high school,

195
16:30.182 --> 16:33.354
I've never really fit in with my class.

196
16:35.088 --> 16:40.612
Being at school was always kind of painful.

197
16:42.765 --> 16:49.864
But today, for the first time, I felt like I was having fun.

198
16:52.531 --> 16:54.242
And now...

199
16:56.702 --> 16:58.810
I told you it's fine.

200
16:58.810 --> 17:00.413
But...

201
17:03.260 --> 17:05.195
I have this.

202
17:05.195 --> 17:06.535
Huh?

203
17:09.542 --> 17:12.337
For when they get confiscated.

204
17:30.612 --> 17:32.632
Want a touch?

205
17:32.632 --> 17:37.489
A touch? I couldn't possibly do that.

206
17:37.489 --> 17:39.316
That's funny.

207
17:42.208 --> 17:44.321
Hey, Taguchi.

208
17:47.211 --> 17:51.874
Well, if you'd like, how about you and I...

209
18:03.053 --> 18:04.729
You awake?

210
18:07.128 --> 18:10.519
The taxi's almost here. Get some more sleep.

211
18:10.519 --> 18:13.154
Yeah, thanks.

212
18:13.154 --> 18:14.734
No problem.

213
18:23.868 --> 18:25.428
Your ear.

214
18:30.211 --> 18:33.313
Oh, the holes are still there.

215
18:36.428 --> 18:38.031
Want a touch?

216
18:40.224 --> 18:41.930
Just kidding.

217
18:47.204 --> 18:49.774
They're still there.

218
18:54.693 --> 18:57.422
Taguchi, you might have changed...

219
19:00.315 --> 19:02.779
but you're still the same.

220
19:10.209 --> 19:12.138
To be honest,

221
19:13.914 --> 19:16.640
I still wear them sometimes.

222
19:21.238 --> 19:24.814
Today, I remembered my high school days

223
19:24.814 --> 19:27.387
and ended up bringing these.

224
19:29.211 --> 19:31.095
Well...

225
19:31.797 --> 19:35.639
the vibes didn't feel right to wear them though.

226
19:53.746 --> 19:55.206
What?

227
19:55.899 --> 20:00.555
Sorry, they just bring back so many memories,

228
20:00.555 --> 20:03.296
and they suit you so well.

229
20:03.939 --> 20:06.399
It's kinda like...

230
20:08.649 --> 20:12.303
a "Welcome back, Taguchi" moment.

231
20:16.069 --> 20:21.445
I like this Taguchi the best.

232
20:27.460 --> 20:30.687
You can't just say that. It's not fair.

233
20:32.059 --> 20:33.515
Huh?

234
20:46.708 --> 20:48.321
The taxi's here.

235
20:51.190 --> 20:53.333
Let's go, then.

236
20:53.333 --> 20:54.920
Okay.

237
21:00.922 --> 21:02.669
Take care.

238
21:08.612 --> 21:10.039
Wait.

239
21:14.276 --> 21:20.948
If you'd like, how about you and I become friends again?

240
21:27.121 --> 21:28.916
Is that a no?

241
21:33.814 --> 21:36.455
I want us to be friends too.

242
21:43.273 --> 21:45.527
More than just friends.

243
21:50.876 --> 21:52.751
Well, good night.

244
21:52.751 --> 21:54.758
Please take her home.

245
22:04.489 --> 22:08.620
I think I'm living all right in the present.

246
22:08.620 --> 22:10.663
I have a gentle family,

247
22:10.663 --> 22:13.646
- and coworkers at a comfortable distance. - Ms. Yamane,

248
22:13.646 --> 22:16.967
the engineer assigned here has arrived. Is now a good time?

249
22:16.967 --> 22:19.274
Yes, it's fine.

250
22:21.336 --> 22:22.976
But...

251
22:24.413 --> 22:27.282
This is Taguchi, the engineer.

252
22:27.282 --> 22:32.332
Starting today, he'll be stationed here every day as a project member.

253
22:32.332 --> 22:34.131
Every day...

254
22:34.131 --> 22:36.751
Handle the rest, okay?

255
22:36.751 --> 22:38.298
Okay.

256
22:47.269 --> 22:50.005
What a coincidence.

257
22:50.005 --> 22:52.658
Yeah, I'm shocked.

258
22:55.761 --> 22:57.970
Did you get home okay?

259
22:58.591 --> 23:00.086
Yeah.

260
23:02.280 --> 23:05.488
I'll go get a laptop and access card.

261
23:06.161 --> 23:07.752
Sorry.

262
23:08.571 --> 23:10.413
This must be awkward.

263
23:12.134 --> 23:14.514
Not at all.

264
23:15.701 --> 23:17.688
Well...

265
23:21.658 --> 23:24.060
This works better for me.

266
23:26.243 --> 23:31.271
I look forward to working with you, Ms. Yamane.

267
23:31.271 --> 23:35.036
Those days when everything seemed to shine...

268
23:35.676 --> 23:38.009
Likewise.

269
23:38.009 --> 23:42.503
What if they come back even more vividly?

270
23:45.365 --> 23:47.050
Wanna get lunch together?

271
23:47.050 --> 23:48.151
Sure.

272
23:48.151 --> 23:49.155
Want some?

273
23:49.155 --> 23:51.798
Being together is fun,

274
23:51.798 --> 23:54.209
and it's hard to wait till we meet again.

275
23:54.209 --> 23:57.018
I couldn't say it yesterday or today, but tomorrow...

276
23:57.018 --> 23:59.992
I just couldn't forget about Yamane.
